esign. Within Process Flow Calculations, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of process specifications within Chemical Process Calculations, particularly where the Process Flow Calculations module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of process specifications, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'process specifications; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of process specifications, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Chemical Process Calculations', 'Active'), ('KCR_000663', 'numerical solution', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Chemical Process Calculations', 'Technical Concept', 'Use of numerical algorithms to solve process equations when analytical solutions are unavailable or inconvenient.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of numerical solution within Chemical Process Calculations, particularly where the Process Flow Calculations module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of numerical solution, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Use of numerical algorithms to solve process equations when analytical solutions are unavailable or inconvenient. Within Process Flow Calculations, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of numerical solution within Chemical Process Calculations, particularly where the Process Flow Calculations module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of numerica